        id: "what-is-brand-identity",
        heading: "What Is Brand Identity?",
        content:
          "Brand identity is the collection of visual and verbal elements that represent your business — how your brand looks, sounds, and feels across every touchpoint. It encompasses your logo, colour palette, typography, imagery style, tone of voice, and the overall personality you project to the world. Brand identity is the intentional, strategic expression of who you are as a business and what you stand for.\n\nCritically, brand identity is not the same as brand. Your brand is the perception that exists in customers' minds — the sum of every experience they've had with your business. Your brand identity is the set of tools you use to shape and influence that perception. A strong, consistent brand identity helps you communicate your values, attract the right customers, and differentiate yourself from competitors.",
