        heading: "Why Brand Identity Drives Business Growth",
        content:
          "Consistent brand presentation across all platforms increases revenue by up to 23%, according to research by Lucidpress. This isn't magic — it's the cumulative effect of recognition and trust. When customers encounter your brand repeatedly and it always looks and feels the same, they develop familiarity. Familiarity breeds trust. Trust drives purchase decisions and referrals.\n\nFor digital businesses, brand identity has additional impact in reducing acquisition costs. Strong brands earn more organic attention — people share content from brands they like and trust. In markets like Singapore and Indonesia where digital competition is intense, a memorable brand identity helps you stand out in crowded feeds, earn higher click-through rates on ads, and command premium pricing.",
